## 7. Flash Loan Induced Reentrancy

Flash loans can trigger reentrancy in callbacks.

```solidity
// Common pattern in flash loan receivers
interface IFlashLoanReceiver {
    function executeOperation(
        address[] calldata assets,
        uint256[] calldata amounts,
        uint256[] calldata premiums,
        address initiator,
        bytes calldata params
    ) external returns (bool);
}

// Inside executeOperation, attacker can call back into lending protocol
```

